What:		/sys/class/pon/pon<N>omci0/statistics/rx_messages
Date:		October 2026
KernelVersion:	6.18
Contact:	netdev@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		(RO) Number of OMCI messages from the OLT queued for the reader of
		the port's character device.
		See Documentation/networking/pon.rst.

What:		/sys/class/pon/pon<N>omci0/statistics/rx_dropped
Date:		October 2026
KernelVersion:	6.18
Contact:	netdev@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		(RO) Number of OMCI messages from the OLT dropped because the
		port's character device was not open, or because its reader
		was 64 messages behind.
		See Documentation/networking/pon.rst.

What:		/sys/class/pon/pon<N>omci0/statistics/rx_discarded
Date:		October 2026
KernelVersion:	6.18
Contact:	netdev@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		(RO) Number of OMCI messages from the OLT still waiting for the
		reader when the OMCI channel went down, and discarded then.
		See Documentation/networking/pon.rst.

What:		/sys/class/pon/pon<N>omci0/statistics/tx_messages
Date:		October 2026
KernelVersion:	6.18
Contact:	netdev@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		(RO) Number of OMCI messages to the OLT that the MAC accepted for
		transmission.
		See Documentation/networking/pon.rst.

What:		/sys/class/pon/pon<N>omci0/statistics/tx_errors
Date:		October 2026
KernelVersion:	6.18
